## Notes

- Always update ROADMAP and SESSION_LOG
- Keep session logs concise - key decisions only
- Feature tags help track work across worktrees
- Test before committing, always
- Capture orchestration blockers or delegated-review findings in SESSION_LOG when they affect the result
- Check `{{DOCS_PATH}}/CUSTOM.md` for project-specific commit conventions or PR templates
